{
  "about": "The map's look over the OpenMapTiles schema, read by the unit's renderer and by the browser emulator. Layers draw in order. A layer matches a source layer, optionally `classes` (the feature's class is one of them), `where` (each key equals) and `not` (no key equals). Widths and sizes are a number or {base, stops: [[zoom, value], ...]}, interpolated exponentially by base (1 is linear). Colours name palette entries; `day` / `night` limit a layer to one palette.",
